n_marina:"For marinas",n_werkstatt:"For boatyards",n_ablauf:"How it works",n_bedarf:"Demand check",n_fin:"Financing",n_technik:"Technology",n_ueber:"About us",cta:"Book a call",
h_eye:"Antifouling platform for marinas and boat services · Germany and the Nordics",
h_h1:"Antifouling for your owners, <em>from quote to payment.</em>",
h_lead:"Your own calculator with your prices, booking with photos and a fixed date, a deposit or instalments for the owner. A laser does the removal, up to 80% faster than sanding. You pay 5% of the revenue that runs through it, nothing else.",
d1_tag:"No investment",d1_h:"I refer jobs",d1_p:"You put up the calculator, your owners book, a laser partner from your region does the work. You earn 15% commission.",d1_go:"For marinas →",
d2_tag:"With your own laser",d2_h:"I do the work",d2_p:"Laser financed via GRENKE, jobs from your own calculator and 2 years of area protection for launch partners.",d2_go:"For boatyards →",
h_hint:"Not sure it pays off? <a href=\"#test\">Start as a referrer for 6 weeks</a> and see how many of your owners book.",
a_eye:"How it works",a_h:"One cycle, four parties",
a1_w:"Owner",a1_h:"Calculates and books",a1_p:"Scans the QR code on the pontoon, sees the price with your values right away, uploads photos and picks a date.",
a2_w:"Marina",a2_h:"Reviews and quotes",a2_p:"Reviews the photos in the back office and sends a fixed-price quote. The owner accepts online and pays 50% or finances.",
a3_w:"Laser partner",a3_h:"Confirms and does the work",a3_p:"Confirms the date. Laser removal, new coating with branded antifouling, at the berth or in winter storage.",
a4_w:"Statement",a4_h:"Runs through the platform",a4_p:"5% to Boatsdoc. If the marina referred the job, the business doing the work pays it 15% commission.",
a_note:"<b>The deposit stays refundable until the business doing the work confirms the date.</b> A marina can collect bookings before it is clear who will do the work. No owner pays for a date nobody keeps.",
v_eye:"See for yourself",v_h:"What your owner sees. What you see.",v_lead:"Both videos show the running system, with a Finnmaster motorboat as the example.",
v1_eye:"Owner · 80 seconds",v1_h:"The calculator for your owners",v1_p:"From the QR code through price, photos and preferred date to accepting with Klarna.",v1_btn:"Try the calculator ↗",
v2_eye:"Marina · 2 minutes",v2_h:"Your back office",v2_p:"Review a request, send a fixed price, pass it to the laser partner, set prices, QR code and flyer, statements.",v2_btn:"Open back-office demo ↗",
v_note:"The videos use sample data. Try it yourself: with the sample marina’s calculator or your own test account.",
b_eye:"Demand check",b_h:"Your customers are already berthed with you",b_lead:"Antifouling is fully renewed about every 5 years. With 200 berths, around 40 boats need new antifouling every year. The question is who gets the job.",
b_plaetze:"Berths and winter storage places",b_anteil:"Share that books through you",b_anteil_s:"Realistic in the first year: 15–30%.",b_preis:"Price per job, net",b_preis_s:"Starting value: Boatsdoc recommendation for 25 m². You set your own prices in the back office.",
b_db:"Your contribution margin per job",b_db_s:"Assumption: after labour and material, before the machine. Use your own figure.",
b_f1:"Boats needing it per year",b_f2:"Of which through you",b_f3:"Net revenue per year",
o1_eye:"No machine",o1_h:"Refer",o1_be:"Pays from the first job. 15% commission minus 5% platform fee.",
o2_eye:"Do it yourself",o2_h:"With BD-500",o3_eye:"Do it yourself",o3_h:"With BD-1000",
o_be:"Breaks even from {n} boats a year.",o_nie:"At this margin the machine does not pay for itself.",best:"Best for you",pro_jahr:"Result per year",
b_foot:"GRENKE, 60 months, net, subject to credit check: BD-500 €404, BD-1000 €800 per month. The BD-1000 saves about 20 working hours per 33 m² boat compared with the BD-500 (€45/h). The 5% platform fee is included. All figures are estimates.",
t_eye:"Test for 6 weeks",t_h:"Collect bookings first, then decide on the machine",t_lead:"Every marina starts as a referrer, without risk. Whether a laser of your own pays off is shown by your own bookings, not by our promises.",
t1_w:"Autumn · 6 weeks",t1_h:"Test",t1_p:"QR code at haul-out, with the winter storage invoice and by email to the berth list. Owners book spring dates.",
t2_w:"Mid-December",t2_h:"Decide",t2_p:"Your back office shows bookings, revenue and what a machine of your own would bring. Do the work or refer it.",
t3_w:"January – February",t3_h:"Get the machine",t3_p:"GRENKE application, delivery in 4–6 weeks, training. Order by mid-February at the latest so the machine is there for the season.",
t4_w:"March – May",t4_h:"Season",t4_p:"The booked jobs run. If it is not enough for a machine, the laser partner does the work and you earn the commission.",
t_kit:"Calculator with your name and prices|QR code and A5 flyer|Email template for your berth holders|Talking points for the harbour master|Everything in 6 languages",
m_eye:"For marinas",m_h:"Offer antifouling without a machine or staff",m_lead:"Your owners ask anyway who will do the underwater hull. With Boatsdoc you have an answer, with a fixed price and date, and you earn from it.",
