m2_h:"Owner books with photos and deposit",m2_p:"You see every request in the back office and send a fixed-price quote. The owner accepts online.",
m3_h:"Laser partner does the work",m3_p:"A business with a laser from your region takes over. The customer stays your customer.",
m_money_eye:"Your earnings on a €4,000 net job",m_money_p:"15% commission from the business doing the work, 5% of which goes to Boatsdoc. No base fee, no licence, no monthly costs.",m_money_l:"Want to do the work later? <a href=\"#werkstatt\">For boatyards →</a>",
w_eye:"For boatyards and boat services",w_h:"Up to 80% faster than sanding. The jobs come with it.",w_lead:"A laser on its own is an investment. With the calculator, the owners of your partner marinas and area protection, it stays busy.",
